{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>With a hand-stone.</b> That has in it a full handful (Sifrei)." "<b>Whereby one may die.</b> That has in it a measure sufficient to kill — as the Targum renders; since it is said ״וְהִכָּה אִישׁ אֶת רֵעֵהוּ בְּאֶבֶן״ (Exodus 21) and no measure is given for it — I might say any amount at all; therefore <b>whereby one may die</b> is said."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:13:51.344390602Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}